ation}{\\Delta t}>0\\\\0&\\text{otherwise}\\end{cases}","ascii":"For a nonempty track, p=I(a,b,t); speed=d(a,b)/duration only when active with positive duration, otherwise 0. I is linear interpolation in planar mode or spherical interpolation with continuous longitude. Binary search picks the latest duplicate row; t is the clamped elapsed-time fraction, held at 0 in a gap and at the endpoint outside the span. Empty tracks output zeros.","symbols":[{"id":"position","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:currentPositions"},{"id":"speed","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:speeds"},{"id":"start","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:startPosition"},{"id":"end","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:endPosition"},{"id":"fraction","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:fraction"},{"id":"duration","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:duration"},{"id":"status","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:status"},{"id":"interpolate","role":"intermediate","binding":"wgsl:interpolatePosition"},{"id":"length","role":"intermediate","binding":"wgsl:getSegmentLength"}]},{"id":"gpu-core.compaction","tex":"\\term{offsets}{o_i}=\\sum_{j<i}\\term{flags}{f_j}\\bmod2^{32},\\quad\\term{y}{y_{o_i}}=\\term{x}{x_i}\\ (f_i\\ne0),\\quad\\term{count}{c}=o_{n-1}+\\operatorname{min}(f_{n-1},1)","ascii":"o[i]=exclusive uint32 scan(flags); if flags[i]!=0 and o[i] is in output capacity, y[o[i]]=x[i]. count=(o[n-1]+min(flags[n-1],1)) mod 2^32, empty=0. Dense stable compaction requires binary flags; raw nonbinary flags leave gaps.","symbols":[{"id":"x","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:inputValues"},{"id":"y","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:outputValues"},{"id":"flags","role":"input","binding":"wgsl:flags"},{"id":"offsets","role":"intermediate","binding":"wgsl:offsets"},{"id":"count","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:outputCount"}],"derivation":"curated"}],"sources":[{"id":"wgsl:78b5de58","language":"wgsl","moduleId":"GPUTrajectoryPlayhead/bracket","hash":"78b5de58","bodyHash":"987b2136","entryPoint":"main","constants":{"INVOCATION_COUNT":12,"WGSL_KERNEL_D